---
import { buildingAndFloors, tel } from '../../data/site';
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="container hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--kr">
        <Icon name="sprout" />
        대전 송촌동 · 아동청소년 발달센터
      </p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">
        아이의 속도로,
        <br />한 걸음씩{' '}
        <span class="leafline">
          <span>
            쑥쑥<span class="dot">.</span>
          </span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 44" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
            <path
              class="ll-path"
              pathLength="1"
              d="M6 31C70 20 146 38 226 26"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="7"
              fill="none"
              stroke-linecap="round"
            />
            <g class="ll-leaf">
              <path d="M224 27C233 7 260 0 296 4c-9 21-37 31-72 23z" fill="currentColor" />
              <path
                d="M232 24c17-8 36-14 56-17"
                stroke="#fff"
                stroke-width="2.2"
                fill="none"
                stroke-linecap="round"
                opacity=".9"
              />
            </g>
          </svg>
        </span>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">
        발달재활 치료부터 움직임 스튜디오, 승마·VR 체험까지.
        <br /> 한 건물 안에서 우리 아이의 성장을 함께 설계합니다.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href={tel}>
          <Icon name="phone" />
          상담 예약하기
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="#programs">
          프로그램 둘러보기
          <Icon name="arrow" />
        </a>
      </div>
      <ul class="hero-trust">
        <li>
          <span class="mohw">
            <img src="/assets/img/gov-emblem.png" alt="" width="20" height="20" />
            보건복지부
          </span>{' '}
          사회서비스 제공기관
        </li>
        <li>
          <Icon name="pin" />
          {buildingAndFloors}
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-media">
      <div class="leaf-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <figure class="leaf-frame">
        <picture>
          <source
            type="image/webp"
            srcset="/assets/img/photos/hero-outdoor-720.webp 720w, /assets/img/photos/hero-outdoor-1080.webp 1080w"
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 440px, 72vw"
          />
          <img
            src="/assets/img/photos/hero-outdoor-1080.jpg"
            width="1080"
            height="1260"
            alt="선생님과 아이들이 손을 잡고 겨울 언덕길을 함께 걸어 내려오는 모습"
            fetchpriority="high"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </picture>
      </figure>
      <div class="hero-circle" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/assets/img/photos/horse-800.webp" alt="" width="800" height="600" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
      </div>
      <Icon name="doodle" class="hero-doodle" />
      <Icon name="heart" class="hero-heart" />
      <div class="float-badge fb-1 glass glass--strong">
        <span class="badge-ic">
          <Icon name="check" />
        </span>
        <span>
          1:1 맞춤 발달재활<small>언어 · 감각통합 · 인지 · 운동</small>
        </span>
      </div>
      <div class="float-badge fb-2 glass glass--strong">
        <span class="badge-ic badge-ic--pink">
          <Icon name="sprout" />
        </span>
        <span>
          승마 · VR · 음악 활동<small>몸으로 배우는 프로그램</small>
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
